Wind Shear
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_WindShear 
    Actions
        -------- ================================== --------
        Set VariableSet WindShear_Caster = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet WindShear_Target = (Target unit of ability being cast)
        Set VariableSet WindShear_DummyPoint = (Position of WindShear_Target)
        -------- ================================== --------
        Unit - Order WindShear_Target to Stop.
        -------- Create Dummy Silencer --------
        Unit - Create 1 DummyWindShear for (Owner of WindShear_Caster) at BL_Point facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet WindShear_Dummy = (Last created unit)
        Unit - Add a 2.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
        Unit - Order WindShear_Dummy to Neutral Dark Ranger - Silence WindShear_DummyPoint
